## Later — client interoperability and agent runtime
- [ ] Test OpenCode + 9Router routes and streaming against real adapters.
- [ ] Add `/v1/responses` and provider-native streaming where available.
- [ ] Build checkpointing across browser conversations without duplicating commands.
- [ ] Implement workspace/shell/file tools in a **separate standalone agent**.
- [ ] Add Git checkpoints, approvals, steering, and patch rollback.

## Guardrails
- Never run model-produced shell commands in the bridge.
- Do not treat reconnect as permission to resubmit an ambiguous remote turn.
- Never commit profile/cookie/session/token material.
- Do not claim support for a web model until a real test proves it.
